215 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 403 0 R
/E (The function neuralNetwork\(inputnodes, hiddennodes, outputnodes, learningrate\) is used as an initialization function. It initializes the neural network's structure and weights. The weight initialization is done through Xavier Initialization. In this initialization, weights are randomized and scaled by the inverse square root of the number of input connections. It helps prevent vanishing/exploding gradients during training.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
216 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 404 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
