/P 406 0 R
/E (The test function evaluates the network's prediction accuracy on a given input. It takes three parameters, namely the initialized neural network, a vector of inputs and a target number. The function first runs the query function and saves the returned vector of outputs into a variable named final. It then returns 1 if the target number is equal to the maximum of the output vector, and returns 0 otherwise.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [0]
>>
